# Files the Vercel CLI must never upload with a deployment.
#
# `.env` holds the Bachs and Flutterwave SECRET keys (BACHS_SECRET_KEY,
# FLUTTERWAVE_SECRET_KEY, FLUTTERWAVE_ENCRYPTION_KEY). This project is not a
# git repository, so `.gitignore` alone is not a guarantee here — this file
# makes the exclusion explicit for `vercel deploy` / `vercel build`.
#
# Configure the real values in the Vercel dashboard (or `vercel env add`)
# instead; they are injected into the /api functions at runtime.

.env
.env.*
.env.local

# Local artefacts — Vercel installs and builds these itself.
node_modules
dist
.vercel
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
